tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">快手KwaiKAT发布KAT-Coder-Pro V2.5，首个端到端跑通完整工程的国产Agentic编程模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩功能</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic升级Claude Code，内置浏览器支持AI自主访问网页</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果正式起诉OpenAI窃取商业机密，涉及前高管及核心AI硬件项目</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4e00db68792d1adfd388d6be49287547.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果公司于2026年7月10日向美国加州北区地方法院提起诉讼，指控OpenAI涉嫌窃取商业秘密及违反合同。诉状指出，OpenAI首席硬件官唐·谭（Tang Tan）被控指使系统性窃密，包括利用苹果机密项目代号及要求求职者携带硬件组件面试。此外，前苹果工程师刘畅被控离职后利用未归还设备下载包含未发布技术规格、工程演示及项目数据的机密文档。苹果称OpenAI已在其硬件产品中非法使用包括proprietary金属表面处理技术在内的机密信息。目前，OpenAI正通过其收购的初创公司io研发一款基于AI Agent的智能手机，直接威胁苹果核心硬件业务。苹果已申请法庭禁令，要求禁止OpenAI使用或披露相关商业秘密。OpenAI则在X平台回应称对他人商业秘密不感兴趣，将继续专注研发。此案或将重塑AI硬件生态的竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱启动Touch High摸高计划，押注全自动化智能体与自我训练技术</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2baaa58d47b95d420ecac165763f6ef0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱创始人唐杰发布内部信，宣布启动“Touch High（摸高）计划”，未来两年将战略投入长程任务、自治智能体系统、完全自我训练及安全治理四大核心引擎，旨在冲击下一代AGI。智谱近期已开源GLM-5.2模型，支持1M上下文，并采用MIT协议。技术路线上，智谱将推动模型从即时问答向宏大工程规划演进，通过构建成千上万个专业智能体协作，加速数字生产力向全自动化公司（NPC）形态转型。同时，智谱将建设高质量合成数据工厂，利用AI博弈对抗（Self-Play）实现完全自我训练与代码重构，并投入百亿级资源攻坚“机械可解释性”，以实现黑盒系统向透明系统的转变。此次战略调整发生于智谱港股估值波动期，截至7月10日，其总市值回落至7312亿港元。智谱此举旨在通过技术突破应对行业商业变现压力，在物理极限与安全治理红线间寻求AGI发</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">快手KwaiKAT发布KAT-Coder-Pro V2.5，首个端到端跑通完整工程的国产Agentic编程模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/81e9525d3c773a1978e29b7aced20e37.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">快手KwaiKAT团队正式发布旗舰级Agentic Coding模型KAT-Coder-Pro V2.5，旨在实现从代码补全向独立完成完整软件工程任务的跨越。该模型通过自研AutoBuilder流水线，将可运行仓库环境构建成功率从16.5%提升至57.2%，并引入KwaiClawEnv体系支持长链路任务执行。在训练层面，模型放弃纯监督微调，采用大规模Agentic强化学习，结合非对称PPO架构与分层奖励机制，并通过MOPD多教师在线策略蒸馏融合五大专家模型能力。评测数据显示，其SWE-Bench Pro得分65.2，PinchBench得分94.2，具备直接承接完整Issue的能力。目前KAT-Coder-Pro V2.5已全量上线StreamLake平台，开放API申请与技术文档查阅，支持跨文件定位、自主调试</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab4da36137c14965b56ec16876692b7a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta 正式发布旗舰 LLM Muse Spark 1.1，重点优化多代理自动化工作流程，现已通过 Meta AI 及 API 进入公众预览。该模型支持 100 万标记的上下文窗口，并引入上下文压缩机制，能有效保存关键细节以实现子任务间的数据传递。在多代理协作中，主代理可根据执行变化动态调整计划。性能方面，Muse Spark 1.1 在 Vibe Code Bench v1.1 基准测试中得分 72.2，较前代提升超 50 分；在 SWE-Atlas Codebase QnA 测试中得分提升近 18%。该模型具备自动识别技术问题、修复代码及处理多步骤任务（如电商描述生成、订单执行）的能力。Meta 计划明年将数据中心容量提升至 14 千兆瓦，并有望推出自研 AI 芯片 Iris。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic升级Claude Code，内置浏览器支持AI自主访问网页</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7eaa8438d9c6f2649b885a334d0599e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日为开发者工具Claude Code推出重大升级，正式集成内置浏览器窗口，赋予AI在应用内部直接打开、阅读、点击及输入信息的能力。该功能采用标签页式管理，支持通过快捷键唤醒，旨在帮助开发者在工具内高效检索技术文档及追踪问题记录。为保障安全性，Anthropic部署了多重审查机制，系统分类器会对外部写入操作进行筛查，且在未获明确授权下，Claude无法执行购买、注册或破解CAPTCHA等操作。该浏览器运行于隔离环境，不保存登录凭证。针对企业级需求，组织可通过白名单限制访问范围或完全禁用该功能。对于需在已登录会话中操作的场景，官方建议配合Chrome扩展程序使用。此次更新标志着AI Agent技术在工具链集成与安全管控方面的进一步落地。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
